# PatientFlow API

PatientFlow API is a healthcare workflow API built with .NET 8 and SQL Server.

The project models healthcare workflows using FHIR-inspired resources such as Patients, Encounters, Observations, and Service Requests. It is designed to strengthen backend engineering skills in healthcare interoperability, SQL Server development, and CI/CD automation.

## Tech Stack

- .NET 8 Web API
- SQL Server
- EF Core
- Dapper
- Docker
- GitHub Actions

## Planned Features

- Patient management
- Clinical encounters
- Observations/vitals
- Service requests/orders
- Stored procedures and reporting
- CI/CD pipelines
